{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You know how it is \u2014 a lifetime of dreaming, struggling, chasing that one big break\u2026 and just when it feels like the world is finally at your feet, everything falls apart. <strong>Shit happens.</strong> Luckily, there\u2019s Uncle. And Uncle\u2019s got a motel.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><strong>Every day\u2019s the same:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Making beds, taking out trash, fresh towels, a supply cart, and surprises no one asked for.   <br>Life\u2019s not fireworks. No success, no applause. But there\u2019s dark humor, sometimes even horror \u2014 and when those two mix, you get drama. <strong>Real-life drama.</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734400/extras/GIF1_bedding.gif?t=1748522198\" /></div>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>My</strong>\u00a0<strong>Style? Noir.</strong>   <br>Sometimes it feels like this whole thing is a mystery \u2014 just without the question. But I hold the camera. Where I point it, that\u2019s what I uncover.   <br>   <br><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">First-Person Interactive Gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Room Service Work Simulation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Noir-Inspired Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engaging Storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival Elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive Experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Puzzle-Solving Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Money-Earning System</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3734400?t=1748522198","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734400/0d4c4d290b042794af7a83ffd22589d9785265c3/page_bg_raw.j